# AutoCAD – Architectural Planning

This section contains the architectural drawings developed for the G+1 residential building.

## Software Used
- AutoCAD

## Contents
- 2D Floor Plan
- Room Layout
- Architectural Dimensions

## Files
- `2D_Floor_Plan.dwg` – Editable AutoCAD drawing
- `2D_Floor_Plan.pdf` – Drawing in PDF format

## Description

The architectural floor plan was prepared using AutoCAD. The drawing shows the arrangement of rooms, including bedrooms,
kitchen, living area, hall, toilets, and other spaces with their respective dimensions.
